{'symbol': 'IDXX', 'date': '2019-10-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'IDEXX LABORATORIES, INC. UPDATES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR FULL YEAR 2019; PROVIDES PRELIMINARY EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR 2020', 'text': "IDEXX LABORATORIES, INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR FULL YEAR 2019. FOR THE YEAR, THE COMPANY IS UPDATING ITS REVENUE OUTLOOK TO $2,395 MILLION - $2,405 MILLION. AT MID-POINT, THE UPDATED REVENUE OUTLOOK IS $5 MILLION ABOVE COMPANY'S PREVIOUS GUIDANCE REFLECTING PROJECTED ORGANIC REVENUE GROWTH AT THE HIGHER END OF COMPANY'S PREVIOUS GUIDANCE RANGE. THE COMPANY ALSO UPDATED ITS EPS OUTLOOK TO $4.72 - $4.78, REFLECTING A DECREASE OF $0.12 PER SHARE AT MID-POINT, INCORPORATING A PROJECTED $0.18 NEGATIVE IMPACT FROM CEO TRANSITION CHARGES IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2019 AND A NEGATIVE $0.02 PER SHARE IMPACT RELATED TO UPDATED FOREIGN EXCHANGE ASSUMPTIONS.FOR THE YEAR 2020, THE COMPANY REPORTED REVENUE GUIDANCE RANGE OF $2,610 MILLION - $2,650 MILLION AND EPS GUIDANCE RANGE OF $5.30 - $5.46."}